    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i read about the drowsiness part but i'm not looking to get \"high\" or anything lol. i just need to sleep. is it really that dangerous? i've heard people take them together all the time. wouldn't it just make me sleep deeper? i just wanna know if it's actually unsafe or if you're just being super cautious.",
